      "writtenOn": "2026-04-09T18:17:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From my understanding, the iommu_iotlb_gather API doesn\u0027t do much. the freelist is to free the pages after the unmap and holds on to the pages until caches are invalidated. For deferred flushing, intel iommu doesn\u0027t keep track of the ranges rather does a flush all with `intel_flush_iotlb_all`. I was kind of optimizing it a bit. I did not systematically gather numbers to measure performance, but doing a flush all seemed a bit big hammer to me and hence did an easy optimization.",
      "parentUuid": "6511cbe2_e1fadeb4",
      "revId": "f61cd346baefda5f6e40c03dde01678520eaf417",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
